  "title": "Vertiv Teams Up with Columbus Crew SC as Founding Partner and Supplier of Data Center Infrastructure for New Crew Stadium",
  "summary": "Vertiv (NYSE: VRT), will be a Founding Partner and Official Data Center Equipment Provider of Columbus Crew SC as the club moves into its new home, New Crew Stadium, in July. Vertiv will equip the data center supporting the team’s administrative and in-game IT needs.",
